<main class="min-h-screen bg-base-200 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
  <section class="card bg-base-100 w-full max-w-md shadow-sm">
    <div class="card-body gap-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2">
        <div class="badge badge-outline badge-accent badge-xl h-fit w-fit p-2">
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            fill="none"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            stroke-width="1.5"
            stroke="currentColor"
            class="size-9"
          >
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              d="M15 19.128a9.38 9.38 0 0 0 2.625.372 9.337 9.337 0 0 0 4.121-.952 4.125 4.125 0 0 0-7.533-2.493M15 19.128v-.003c0-1.113-.285-2.16-.786-3.07M15 19.128v.106A12.318 12.318 0 0 1 8.624 21c-2.331 0-4.512-.645-6.374-1.766l-.001-.109a6.375 6.375 0 0 1 11.964-3.07M12 6.375a3.375 3.375 0 1 1-6.75 0 3.375 3.375 0 0 1 6.75 0Zm8.25 2.25a2.625 2.625 0 1 1-5.25 0 2.625 2.625 0 0 1 5.25 0Z"
            />
          </svg>
        </div>

        <h1 class="card-title">グループ名 への招待</h1>

        <p class="text-base-content/70 text-center">
          開発チーム に招待されています。このグループに参加しますか？
        </p>
      </div>

      <form class="card-actions">
        <%= link_to "戻る", root_path, class: "btn btn-outline flex-1" %>

        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary flex-1">参加する</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
